# A kick far too weak to bleach anything: the fields obey linear equations with constant coefficients, and light sloshes between the cavities at the coupling rate while it decays.
# Reference: the closed form from the eigenmodes of the coupled cavities, within 0.2%.
title Dark regime: ring4
sites 4
path 1 4 kappa=0.1
link 4 1 kappa=0.1
kick 1 amplitude=0.001
run 45
expect total 0
expect count 1 0
expect count 2 0
expect count 3 0
expect count 4 0
expect intensity 1 6 7.66994549e-08 2e-3
expect intensity 2 6 3.58986562e-08 2e-3
expect intensity 3 6 1.68021209e-08 2e-3
expect intensity 4 6 3.58986562e-08 2e-3
expect intensity 3 14 1.41416823e-08 2e-3
expect total 0
